# Code conventions

- Composition API + `<script setup lang="ts">`. Pinia setup stores (`defineStore(..., () => { ... })`).
- Types live in `src/types.ts` (`TExtension`, `TRemoteExtensions`). Prefer those names.
- UI primitives: shadcn-vue under `src/components/ui/` (New York style). App chrome: `src/layouts/AppLayout.vue`.
- Toasts: `vue-sonner` (`toast.success` / `error` / `loading`).
- Forms: vee-validate + zod (see `AuthView.vue`).
- Icons: `unplugin-icons` with `Icon` prefix, or lucide via shadcn patterns.
- Alias `@` → `src/`. Shared `cn()` helper: `src/lib/utils.ts`.
- Keep store actions focused: `useExtensionsStore` owns chrome.management reads, JSON export/import, and Firestore `backups/{uid}` backup/restore.
- Avoid editing generated `src/auto-imports.d.ts` / `src/components.d.ts` by hand unless regenerating via build.
